WEBVTT

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.500
She's got real sense for her age.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.042
Yeah, that's quite amazing.

00:00:20.125 --> 00:00:22.083
Her form is quite good, too.

00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:24.958
And since she's so young,
she's a fast learner.

00:00:25.292 --> 00:00:28.250
BOUNTY HUNTER - MOROHA
Yeah? You all keep saying I'm young,

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.500
but in this era
I'm way older than all of you!

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:33.958
HIGURASHI FAMILY'S CAT - BUYO
Well, that's impossible.

00:00:33.958 --> 00:00:35.167
HIGURASHI FAMILY'S CAT - BUYO
But it's true.

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:35.333
But it's true.

00:00:35.542 --> 00:00:40.250
I'm probably around 450 years older
than everyone here.

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:42.583
Everyone's looking so energetic.

00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:44.583
GRANDPA
Everyone's looking so energetic.

00:00:44.958 --> 00:00:46.458
Good morning, Grandpa.

00:00:46.458 --> 00:00:49.000
Looks like you're fitting in quite well.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.958
It's been a few days, after all.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:54.500
I see. Since you're doing so well,
I have a gift for you.

00:00:54.625 --> 00:00:56.792
What? You're giving me something?

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:00.458
It's a mummified foot of a Kappa
that brings good fortune.

00:01:00.458 --> 00:01:02.083
Take good care of it, okay?

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:03.750
But this is such a precious item!

00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:05.833
So you understand its value!

00:01:05.833 --> 00:01:09.667
Kagome has such a good daughter.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.667
Thank you, Kagome!

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:14.750
I still have some life left in me!

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:19.208
<i>Oh? So it's finally noticed</i>
<i>our presence, huh?</i>

00:03:03.458 --> 00:03:05.042
"The Gateway to the Past"

00:03:05.958 --> 00:03:07.000
SAINT GABRIEL ACADEMY

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:09.583
<i>I've decided to return to </i>
<i>the Feudal Era.</i>

00:03:10.333 --> 00:03:13.250
<i>If Setsuna and Moroha</i>
<i>are from the Feudal Era,</i>

00:03:13.625 --> 00:03:19.125
<i>then the forest that I grew up in</i>
<i>would also be there.</i>

00:03:19.542 --> 00:03:24.292
<i>That means I raised here, </i>
<i>but was born in the Feudal Era.</i>

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:29.042
<i>I only have gratitude for Papa Sota</i>
<i>for raising someone like me.</i>

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:30.583
<i>But I can't...</i>

00:03:30.875 --> 00:03:32.292
Miss Towa Higurashi.

00:03:32.833 --> 00:03:34.292
Stand up, please.

00:03:34.292 --> 00:03:35.125
Yes.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:37.000
Mr. Osamu Kirin.

00:03:37.208 --> 00:03:40.625
Daydreaming won't help you
understand this context.

00:03:41.083 --> 00:03:44.125
Please read from line 23.

00:03:45.875 --> 00:03:48.333
"I'm going to visit Kyoto next year."

00:03:48.333 --> 00:03:53.083
<i>But learning English probably won't be</i>
<i> that useful in Feudal Japan...</i>

00:03:54.875 --> 00:03:56.625
HIGURASHI
SOTA, MOE, TOWA, MEI

00:04:06.083 --> 00:04:08.792
DEMON SLAYER - SETSUNA

00:04:09.917 --> 00:04:12.292
<i>What can I do so </i>
<i>Setsuna can sleep again?</i>

00:04:13.083 --> 00:04:15.875
What do we do to get
Setsuna's dreams back?

00:04:16.417 --> 00:04:21.292
It goes without saying, Towa.
We gotta capture the Dream Butterfly.

00:04:21.458 --> 00:04:23.750
And where is this butterfly?

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:27.458
Who knows?
But it's definitely not here.

00:04:28.125 --> 00:04:30.292
We must hurry back to
the other world.

00:04:30.542 --> 00:04:35.583
Yep. Get back there,
get the butterfly. Easy-peasy.

00:04:35.583 --> 00:04:38.792
Easy?! Just how are we supposed to
get to the other world?!

00:04:39.167 --> 00:04:40.250
Oh, right.

00:04:40.333 --> 00:04:44.375
But don't sweat it.
It'll turn out okay somehow.

00:04:45.125 --> 00:04:47.292
<i>It doesn't matter if I dream or not.</i>

00:04:48.375 --> 00:04:51.000
<i>It's not like I have ever suffered from it.</i>

00:04:54.042 --> 00:04:55.750
Bravo!

00:04:56.042 --> 00:04:58.833
MOE HIGURASHI
To master this in such a short time!

00:04:59.458 --> 00:05:01.125
It's only thanks to the teacher...

00:05:01.125 --> 00:05:06.250
You're a prodigy that comes once in a hundred,
no, once in five hundred years!

00:05:06.625 --> 00:05:10.625
You can probably become
a worldwide violinist like me some day.

00:05:10.625 --> 00:05:12.208
Setsuna.

00:05:12.875 --> 00:05:14.000
What is it?

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.375
Moroha is calling for you.

00:05:16.375 --> 00:05:17.917
Oh, really?

00:05:17.917 --> 00:05:18.292
MEI HIGURASHI

00:05:18.292 --> 00:05:20.667
MEI HIGURASHI
She said she found a way back home.

00:05:21.875 --> 00:05:24.042
There we go.

00:05:26.458 --> 00:05:29.750
Yo, Setsuna! Rejoice.
I found a way to get back to...

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:31.667
Hey, what's with the clothes?

00:05:32.708 --> 00:05:34.917
You actually look pretty good!

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:36.875
I'll kill you.

00:05:36.875 --> 00:05:39.042
So you found a means to get back?

00:05:39.333 --> 00:05:40.792
I sure did.

00:05:40.917 --> 00:05:46.042
The thing that stole our demon energy
back in the rainbow corridor

00:05:46.042 --> 00:05:48.417
is a demon named Root Head.

00:05:48.833 --> 00:05:49.917
Root Head?

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:53.417
It got tangled with the roots
of the Tree of Ages,

00:05:53.417 --> 00:05:55.667
and created a time-traveling corridor.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.167
I see. You researched well.

00:05:58.333 --> 00:06:01.667
I didn't research it. I asked it myself.

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.875
The root looked pretty bored,
so I asked it some questions

00:06:05.875 --> 00:06:07.792
and then it wouldn't stop talking.

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:13.583
Anyway, we can get back to the other world
by negotiating with Root Head.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:16.500
I see. I suppose we can try it.

00:06:16.958 --> 00:06:18.875
So, what is this?

00:06:18.875 --> 00:06:20.292
Oh, this?

00:06:20.833 --> 00:06:24.500
Just a few things that
we'll be able to use over there.

00:06:25.083 --> 00:06:25.708
NEW SOCIAL STUDIES AND HISTORY

00:06:25.708 --> 00:06:26.458
NEW SOCIAL STUDIES AND HISTORY
Whoops.

00:06:26.958 --> 00:06:29.458
NEW SOCIAL STUDIES AND HISTORY
What the heck is this? Oh well.

00:06:29.792 --> 00:06:31.458
Into the bag it goes!

00:06:31.458 --> 00:06:33.958
Oh, and take a look at this!

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:36.833
This is the bounty that'll buy me lunch.

00:06:37.958 --> 00:06:40.333
Let's see, what else is there?

00:06:40.708 --> 00:06:42.417
How did this all fit in?

00:06:42.417 --> 00:06:43.625
Who knows?

00:06:43.625 --> 00:06:45.417
What's everyone up to?

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:47.750
Welcome home.

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:48.625
Thank you.

00:06:48.625 --> 00:06:49.792
I'm home, Mei.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:53.917
Guess what?
Moroha found a way back home.

00:06:54.083 --> 00:06:54.375
SOTA HIGURASHI

00:06:54.375 --> 00:06:55.792
SOTA HIGURASHI
That's amazing.

00:06:55.792 --> 00:06:56.958
SOTA HIGURASHI
Did you really?

00:06:56.958 --> 00:07:01.667
That backpack!
It looks just like Kagome's.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:05.333
Wouldn't all of that stuff
risk changing history?

00:07:05.458 --> 00:07:09.708
Don't worry. We can just say
it's demon magic or ninjutsu or something.

00:07:09.708 --> 00:07:10.833
Oh, that's right.

00:07:12.042 --> 00:07:13.875
Please take care of this!

00:07:15.417 --> 00:07:16.458
What?!

00:07:16.833 --> 00:07:18.625
RECEIPT
W-When did she...

00:07:18.792 --> 00:07:21.833
It's just some modest shopping
for your cute niece.

00:07:23.333 --> 00:07:25.375
Yeah, real cute...

00:07:25.583 --> 00:07:28.375
All right. Preparations complete.

00:07:28.833 --> 00:07:31.375
Time to make our grand return
to the feudal age!

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:43.750
Papa Sota.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:44.750
Towa.

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:48.125
Grammy said you were here.
Can I talk to you?

00:07:48.125 --> 00:07:50.417
Of course. What is it?

00:07:52.417 --> 00:07:56.333
What a pretty person.
Is she your older sister?

00:07:56.333 --> 00:07:58.667
Yes, her name's Kagome.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.417
What kind of person was she?

00:08:00.417 --> 00:08:01.583
Let's see.

00:08:01.667 --> 00:08:05.375
She was always causing a ruckus,
but for different reasons than yours.

00:08:06.625 --> 00:08:11.292
I'm sorry for troubling you all the time.
I'm always so selfish...

00:08:13.208 --> 00:08:16.542
You're just like her.
And she also went to the Feudal Era...

00:08:18.333 --> 00:08:19.500
How did you...

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:22.375
You want to go with them, don't you?

00:08:23.083 --> 00:08:26.208
But you raised me until now, and...

00:08:26.208 --> 00:08:27.875
Don't worry about it.

00:08:28.583 --> 00:08:31.292
I knew this day would come
sooner or later.

00:08:32.167 --> 00:08:36.833
Ever since I found you barefoot
in front of the Sacred Tree.

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:41.792
Even if I'm here,
I'll cause nothing but trouble for you.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.542
I'm telling you,
you don't have to worry about it.

00:08:47.458 --> 00:08:49.583
Be safe, okay, Towa?

00:08:52.917 --> 00:08:54.167
Thank you.

00:08:54.167 --> 00:08:57.250
I'll be off then... Dad.

00:09:00.875 --> 00:09:05.292
Moroha, the Elder's Association
would like to give you a parting gift.

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:09.083
That's awesome.
Tell them I said thanks!

00:09:09.167 --> 00:09:10.208
Moroha.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:11.167
MEI'S GRANDMOTHER
GRAMMY

00:09:11.167 --> 00:09:13.500
Give my regards to Kagome
if you see her.

00:09:14.083 --> 00:09:18.292
Uh, sure.
Even though I don't really know her.

00:09:18.708 --> 00:09:23.875
To send off a once-in-five-hundred-year prodigy
to the Feudal Era...

00:09:23.875 --> 00:09:26.042
Take care of the violin, okay?

00:09:26.042 --> 00:09:29.375
Oh, this. I'll play it on nights
when I can't fall asleep.

00:09:29.792 --> 00:09:30.750
I'm leaving then.

00:09:31.083 --> 00:09:32.250
Be careful.

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.583
Sis, please come back, okay?

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:37.458
You have to come back!

00:09:37.458 --> 00:09:42.167
You too, Setsuna and Moroha.
Everyone has to come home here.

00:09:48.125 --> 00:09:49.167
Hup!

00:09:49.917 --> 00:09:51.417
Thank you, Mei.

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:54.167
I can't make any promises,
but I'll do my best.

00:09:54.625 --> 00:09:56.667
Just promise me!

00:09:57.125 --> 00:10:01.167
All right. I'll come home once
we get Setsuna's dreams back.

00:10:01.833 --> 00:10:04.167
Come on, promise her,
both of you!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.375
The feudal age isn't
some fairy-tale world.

00:10:07.458 --> 00:10:08.667
If you're not prepared to die...

00:10:08.875 --> 00:10:12.167
I am prepared.
But it's not for death.

00:10:12.167 --> 00:10:15.958
I can keep my head
<i>and </i>come back here safe.

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:22.208
All right, let's get going already.

00:10:24.875 --> 00:10:28.792
Hey, Root Head! We have
something you can't get from this era.

00:10:28.792 --> 00:10:33.208
Three coveted Rainbow Pearls
stuffed with demon power!

00:10:36.958 --> 00:10:39.917
If you let us pass through
to the Feudal Era,

00:10:39.917 --> 00:10:44.083
we'll give you the
Gold, Silver, and Red Rainbow Pearls.

00:10:44.083 --> 00:10:45.708
How's that, Root Head?

00:10:51.958 --> 00:10:54.583
All right. I shall allow you to pass.

00:11:00.583 --> 00:11:03.000
Lady Kaede, that light!

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:03.583
Indeed.

00:11:04.208 --> 00:11:06.333
That's the light from the Sacred Tree.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:09.208
HISUI                    KAEDE
Could Setsuna be returning here?

00:11:09.292 --> 00:11:10.792
That may be so.

00:11:11.125 --> 00:11:11.750
Kirara.

00:11:12.833 --> 00:11:13.917
CAT DEMON - KIRARA

00:11:13.917 --> 00:11:15.708
I'll go notify Uncle.

00:11:19.042 --> 00:11:20.500
There it is!

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:21.833
It's the same as back then.

00:11:25.708 --> 00:11:27.208
Hey, that's mine!

00:11:27.208 --> 00:11:28.958
- Wait!
- Hey!

00:11:29.125 --> 00:11:30.375
Give it back!

00:11:30.375 --> 00:11:31.417
Hey!

00:11:37.083 --> 00:11:39.875
Thank you, everyone.

00:11:40.417 --> 00:11:41.250
I'm heading out now.

00:11:42.417 --> 00:11:44.125
It's a promise, okay?

00:11:44.333 --> 00:11:48.458
I love all of my sisters, okay?

00:11:52.042 --> 00:11:54.000
I'm sure they'll come home.

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:56.750
Because all of them are family, after all.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.625
They're all my adorable
great-grandchildren.

00:11:59.625 --> 00:12:00.792
Yes.

00:12:01.667 --> 00:12:03.083
They really are.

00:12:05.708 --> 00:12:06.792
<i>That's right.</i>

00:12:07.167 --> 00:12:10.833
<i>I must've passed through </i>
<i>this corridor when I was four.</i>

00:12:12.125 --> 00:12:13.917
<i>The Feudal Era is just ahead...</i>

00:12:14.542 --> 00:12:16.750
<i>That's where Setsuna's </i>
<i>dreams were stolen.</i>

00:12:17.375 --> 00:12:20.500
<i>I'll definitely get them back for her!</i>

00:12:20.875 --> 00:12:24.375
Moroha, was it really okay
to make such a promise to Root Head?

00:12:24.375 --> 00:12:25.458
It's fine.

00:12:25.917 --> 00:12:29.167
If it comes to it,
I could just slay Root Head.

00:12:29.292 --> 00:12:30.417
Huh?

00:12:30.417 --> 00:12:33.958
Setsuna, did you just call me
by my name?

00:12:35.292 --> 00:12:36.458
What of it?

00:12:38.208 --> 00:12:40.583
Nothing at all! This isn't so bad.

00:12:40.833 --> 00:12:43.458
It is bad!
You need to keep your promises.

00:12:43.458 --> 00:12:44.625
Lies are bad.

00:12:44.792 --> 00:12:47.750
It wasn't a lie, it was a means to an end.

00:12:58.167 --> 00:13:00.667
A decade's worth of time has passed.

00:13:00.667 --> 00:13:04.000
The Half-Demon Princesses
travel under my feet.

00:13:04.875 --> 00:13:11.000
If my predictions are correct,
those three will save the world.

00:13:11.667 --> 00:13:16.125
For now, I shall let Root Head dream.

00:13:18.083 --> 00:13:20.167
This is the Feudal Era?

00:13:20.167 --> 00:13:22.083
No, something's not right.

00:13:22.083 --> 00:13:22.875
Stay alert.

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:26.000
Moroha, I bet you had us
take the wrong path.

00:13:26.208 --> 00:13:29.125
There is no wrong path
because it's only one path!

00:13:29.458 --> 00:13:32.000
Towa, now is a good time to warn you.

00:13:32.292 --> 00:13:34.917
In the feudal age,
there is no room for "hesitation."

00:13:35.333 --> 00:13:36.667
R-Right...

00:13:36.667 --> 00:13:39.708
If you don't kill your enemy,
they will kill you.

00:13:40.125 --> 00:13:42.333
If it's just you, then it's fine.

00:13:42.333 --> 00:13:46.542
But we can't have you
dragging us down with you!

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.875
Geez, all right.

00:13:48.958 --> 00:13:50.167
Both of you.

00:13:51.667 --> 00:13:52.708
What is this place?

00:14:00.625 --> 00:14:03.500
You've done well to come here,
Half-Demon Princesses.

00:14:04.667 --> 00:14:07.042
You've done well to come here,
Half-Demon Princesses.

00:14:07.458 --> 00:14:10.625
Half-Demon Princesses?
Are you referring to us?

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:12.458
Is this Root Head?

00:14:12.458 --> 00:14:15.333
No, it's not.
I don't sense any demon energy.

00:14:15.458 --> 00:14:16.542
Who are you?

00:14:16.708 --> 00:14:17.083
SPIRIT OF THE TREE OF AGES

00:14:17.083 --> 00:14:19.042
SPIRIT OF THE TREE OF AGES
I am the Tree of Ages.

00:14:20.083 --> 00:14:22.542
Is the Tree of Ages
supposed to look like a priestess?

00:14:23.042 --> 00:14:25.583
No, this is a borrowed appearance.

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:28.458
It appears this form was created

00:14:28.458 --> 00:14:34.958
from the spirit of the Arrow of Sealing
that was stuck on my trunk.

00:14:35.625 --> 00:14:39.875
I believe the priestess' name was Kikyo.

00:14:40.292 --> 00:14:41.500
Kikyo?

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:43.917
Are you the one who summoned us here?

00:14:44.583 --> 00:14:49.417
Yes. Daughters of Sesshomaru,
I have a request for you.

00:14:49.625 --> 00:14:52.708
Ah-ha! So you <i>are </i>Sesshomaru's...

00:14:52.792 --> 00:14:54.625
But hey, wait a second.

00:14:54.625 --> 00:14:57.417
Sorry, but I'm not Sesshomaru's daughter.

00:14:57.708 --> 00:15:00.542
Listen to my tale until the end, Moroha.

00:15:01.792 --> 00:15:04.083
H-How did she know my name?

00:15:04.375 --> 00:15:06.583
So what's this request?

00:15:06.917 --> 00:15:09.667
I would like you to slay a certain demon.

00:15:09.667 --> 00:15:11.833
You got it! It's Root Head, right?

00:15:12.083 --> 00:15:15.583
No. Root Head means nothing to me.

00:15:15.583 --> 00:15:18.708
The demon I would like you to slay
is the Beast King Kirinmaru.

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:20.250
Kirinmaru?

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:22.625
He is attempting to twist time,

00:15:22.625 --> 00:15:25.167
swallow this world
into the degenerate age,

00:15:25.167 --> 00:15:27.333
and return it to nothingness.

00:15:28.292 --> 00:15:31.583
Kirinmaru is a king who,
alongside the Great Dog-Demon,

00:15:31.583 --> 00:15:34.208
had long reigned over the demon beasts.

00:15:35.167 --> 00:15:37.833
Kirinmaru ruled in the East,

00:15:37.833 --> 00:15:41.417
while the one who held the West
was your grandfather,

00:15:41.417 --> 00:15:42.583
the Great Dog-Demon.

00:15:43.833 --> 00:15:48.792
The Great Dog-Demon, huh?
I see, it's a name that I've heard of.

00:15:49.125 --> 00:15:52.708
Equal in strength,
the two warriors ruled their lands

00:15:52.792 --> 00:15:57.167
while keeping watch over the other
to maintain the balance in power.

00:15:57.167 --> 00:16:00.417
However, your father Sesshomaru

00:16:00.417 --> 00:16:05.542
renounced his Great Dog-Demon title
and walked his own path.

00:16:06.417 --> 00:16:09.000
Taking that as an opportunity,

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:12.292
Kirinmaru plots to plunge
this world into devastation.

00:16:12.708 --> 00:16:16.958
The power to travel across time
would be necessary to fight him.

00:16:17.292 --> 00:16:19.292
So that's where we come in.

00:16:19.708 --> 00:16:21.000
Yes.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:24.708
As ones with deep ties to
the Great Dog-Demon,

00:16:24.708 --> 00:16:26.917
you three must slay Kirinmaru.

00:16:27.125 --> 00:16:30.333
You will agree to this, won't you,
Half-Demon Princesses?

00:16:30.625 --> 00:16:32.583
I'm all for it!

00:16:32.583 --> 00:16:36.417
But when I succeed,
I'll be collecting a worthy bounty.

00:16:36.833 --> 00:16:39.583
And you, daughters of Sesshomaru?

00:16:39.958 --> 00:16:40.833
I refuse.

00:16:41.167 --> 00:16:42.083
Huh?!

00:16:42.375 --> 00:16:43.833
You will not do it?

00:16:44.167 --> 00:16:45.292
I will not.

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:47.083
I decline to accept.

00:16:47.583 --> 00:16:48.833
For what reason?

00:16:48.958 --> 00:16:53.500
First, I do not know this Sesshomaru
who you claim is my father.

00:16:53.875 --> 00:16:58.083
Why in the world must we atone for
such a demon's failure?

00:16:58.667 --> 00:17:04.083
If Kirinmaru must be defeated,
then have that Sesshomaru deal with it.

00:17:04.917 --> 00:17:08.083
Tree of Ages,
you're asking the wrong people.

00:17:10.375 --> 00:17:12.875
I was right to place confidence in you.

00:17:14.083 --> 00:17:16.833
Sesshomaru cannot defeat Kirinmaru.

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:21.708
That is because these two Beast Kings
currently walk the same path.

00:17:22.083 --> 00:17:25.208
If you defeat Kirinmaru,
Sesshomaru will emerge.

00:17:25.208 --> 00:17:28.292
Similarly, if you defeat Sesshomaru...

00:17:28.292 --> 00:17:32.000
In other words, you must defeat them
at the same time.

00:17:32.292 --> 00:17:34.000
At the same time?

00:17:34.208 --> 00:17:38.000
You are not atoning for
Sesshomaru's failure.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:42.375
I'm telling you to defeat two demons
who have taken the wrong path.

00:17:42.625 --> 00:17:46.625
Then that's more reason we can't accept
what you're asking us to do.

00:17:47.583 --> 00:17:52.125
Even if we've never met him,
Sesshomaru is our father, right?

00:17:52.125 --> 00:17:55.667
Don't ask his daughters
to do something like that!

00:17:55.792 --> 00:18:01.792
So the two daughters of Sesshomaru
will not accept my request?

00:18:02.167 --> 00:18:04.792
Yes, that's exactly it.
We do not accept!

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.542
Oh, man.

00:18:07.042 --> 00:18:09.792
It seems you do not understand
what will happen...

00:18:10.333 --> 00:18:13.125
if you disobey the Tree of Ages.

00:18:13.833 --> 00:18:16.917
I won't let anyone stop us
from our own mission.

00:18:16.917 --> 00:18:19.042
Yes, we will do as we please.

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:22.417
I ask one last time.
Will you not slay him?

00:18:22.958 --> 00:18:24.375
I will not repeat myself.

00:18:24.375 --> 00:18:25.750
I have no doubts, either.

00:18:25.875 --> 00:18:27.792
Let us pass, or we'll cut you down.

00:18:28.042 --> 00:18:30.292
Wait, are we really doing this?

00:18:30.667 --> 00:18:34.125
Very well.
Fate is a continuously spinning wheel.

00:18:34.208 --> 00:18:35.500
We shall meet again.

00:18:36.292 --> 00:18:37.250
What?

00:18:37.917 --> 00:18:39.083
What's going on?

00:18:39.708 --> 00:18:41.458
Awaken, Root Head.

00:18:41.583 --> 00:18:45.208
The Rainbow Pearls you desire
are getting away.

00:18:48.667 --> 00:18:49.583
Lady Kaede.

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:50.083
KOHAKU

00:18:50.083 --> 00:18:51.958
KOHAKU
Could this presence be...

00:18:51.958 --> 00:18:53.167
KOHAKU
Root Head's demon power is increasing.

00:18:53.167 --> 00:18:54.583
Root Head's demon power is increasing.

00:18:54.583 --> 00:18:55.625
What?

00:18:56.417 --> 00:18:58.125
It's too dangerous here.

00:19:03.083 --> 00:19:04.917
Hey, is everyone okay?

00:19:04.917 --> 00:19:06.000
Where is this?

00:19:06.083 --> 00:19:07.042
Dang it.

00:19:07.167 --> 00:19:11.667
The Tree of Ages sent us
to where Root Head is, of all places.

00:19:11.792 --> 00:19:16.083
A promise is a promise.
Hand over the three Rainbow Pearls.

00:19:16.292 --> 00:19:17.583
So this is Root Head.

00:19:17.792 --> 00:19:20.833
Sorry! We can't give you
the Rainbow Pearls anymore.

00:19:21.083 --> 00:19:23.417
Then perish where you stand.

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:25.542
Cyclone Burst!

00:19:30.208 --> 00:19:32.167
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:19:34.292 --> 00:19:35.833
It'll never end like this.

00:19:35.833 --> 00:19:39.042
Root Head should have a weak spot.
If we can find it...

00:19:44.583 --> 00:19:46.833
What? My energy blade is fading!

00:19:47.125 --> 00:19:49.708
Shit! Your demon powers
are being drained!

00:19:49.708 --> 00:19:51.833
Can't you do anything, Moroha?

00:19:52.708 --> 00:19:54.958
That's right, I had this.

00:19:55.792 --> 00:19:56.625
Here we go!

00:19:56.917 --> 00:20:01.292
Here! Have a taste of a
lucky kappa's foot!

00:20:04.292 --> 00:20:05.667
My powers are back!

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:10.667
Thanks Grandpa!
It really did bring me good fortune.

00:20:11.125 --> 00:20:12.458
We'll hit it all at once.

00:20:12.542 --> 00:20:14.208
Scourge of Swallows!

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:17.792
Heavenly Arrow Barrage!

00:20:23.792 --> 00:20:25.042
<i>That light is...</i>

00:20:25.417 --> 00:20:27.708
Towa! Aim for the spot
under that big eye!

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:30.667
That's its weak spot. Finish it off!

00:20:30.792 --> 00:20:32.917
I won't let you.

00:20:32.917 --> 00:20:34.167
There, huh?

00:20:34.292 --> 00:20:38.333
Don't hesitate, don't hesitate, don't hesitate!

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:42.333
What?

00:20:42.417 --> 00:20:44.750
What's that blue dragon?

00:21:03.875 --> 00:21:06.500
A-All good, Moroha?

00:21:07.417 --> 00:21:09.417
So this is the Feudal Era...

00:21:09.417 --> 00:21:10.583
Setsuna.

00:21:10.833 --> 00:21:11.667
Setsuna!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:13.083
I'm glad you're safe.

00:21:13.458 --> 00:21:15.833
Yes. I have managed to return.

00:21:16.083 --> 00:21:17.708
Well, thank goodness.

00:21:17.708 --> 00:21:21.375
I can't sense Root Head's demon energy.
What happened?

00:21:21.375 --> 00:21:23.333
We defeated it.

00:21:23.333 --> 00:21:25.917
What? I-Is that true?

00:21:25.917 --> 00:21:27.875
<i>O-Oh, that's right.</i>

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:32.458
<i>If we defeated Root Head, how are we</i>
<i>geting back to the modern era?</i>

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:36.208
Maybe this wasn't a good idea.

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:42.750
Those girls have such fighting spirit.

00:21:43.417 --> 00:21:47.250
I am the Tree of Ages,
and yet they refused my wish.

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:49.458
Are you sure about this?

00:21:50.333 --> 00:21:54.625
If you forsake this girl,
she will never awaken.

00:22:03.375 --> 00:22:05.917
I suppose this is one path as well.

00:22:08.333 --> 00:22:12.583
Perhaps staying like this
would be best in the end.

00:23:42.958 --> 00:23:44.250
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:44.250 --> 00:23:47.792
Setsuna and I accept jobs to slay demons.

00:23:47.792 --> 00:23:52.250
While following a boy who collects bones,
we run into Moroha.

00:23:52.250 --> 00:23:54.167
Moroha, your prey is here as well?

00:23:54.167 --> 00:23:58.875
As one of the Four Perils,
Tokotsu's bounty is not just a bag of gold.

00:23:58.875 --> 00:24:00.875
He's worth at least a gold ingot.

00:24:01.167 --> 00:24:04.292
Come on! Let's split the bounty three ways.

00:24:04.292 --> 00:24:08.000
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon:</i>
"Jakotsumaru of the Red Bone Palace"

00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:24.022
Moroha the Demon Killer,
the one who murdered my father!
